Vintage illustration style: A warm, golden-toned scene inside an Asian community center gymnasium. A tall Western father in traditional loose Wushu training clothes stands in a wide horse stance among a group of young children, all mirroring the same martial arts pose with focused expressions. The father towers above the small students but matches their earnest concentration. A young Chinese instructor demonstrates at the front. Wooden training weapons hang on the wall. Late evening light streams through high windows, casting long shadows across the polished wooden floor. The scene captures joy, humility, and cross-generational bonding through movement. Rendered in a nostalgic, slightly faded photographic style reminiscent of 1970s family snapshots with warm amber undertones and soft vignetting around the edges.
